  <h2 id="which-to-download">Which Should You Download?</h2>
  <p><strong>Download 1080p if:</strong> You are going to watch the video on a smartphone or a laptop. On screens smaller than 15 inches, the human eye struggles to tell the difference between 1080p and 4K, making the massive file size of 4K a waste of space.</p>
  <p><strong>Download 4K if:</strong> You plan to cast the video to a large 4K Smart TV in your living room, or if you are downloading stock footage that you plan to edit and crop in professional software.</p>
